    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Lang Ya land spirit activates Divine Sense Gu so divine sense travels into the connecting heaven Gu mirror in waves and exchanges with other divine senses while he buys refinement materials. Fang Yuan later sends his Divine Sense Gu to Hu Immortal blessed land through moving perspective cup Gu.",
