          "gu_moving_perspective_cup_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Little Hu Immortal then uses Divine Sense Gu to talk with merchants in treasure yellow heaven, and heavy divine sense traffic from many Gu Immortals strains her until her cheeks turn pale.",
